# Icons Directory

This directory contains UI icons used throughout the app.

## Recommended Library
Use `@expo/vector-icons` (already included with Expo) or `@lucide-react-native` for consistent iconography.

## Icon Categories
- Navigation icons (home, practice, tests, ai, profile)
- Action icons (bookmark, flag, share, settings)
- Status icons (success, warning, error, info)
- Subject icons (math, science, english, gk, intelligence)
- Achievement icons (trophy, medal, star, fire)

## Usage with Lucide
```tsx
import { Home, BookOpen, Trophy, Settings } from "lucide-react-native";

<Home size={24} color="#4648d4" />
<BookOpen size={20} color="#4648d4" />
```

## Stitch Design System Colors for Icons
- Default: `COLORS.textSecondary` (#464554)
- Active: `COLORS.primary` (#4648d4)
- Success: `COLORS.success` (#22C55E)
- Warning: `COLORS.warning` (#F59E0B)
- Error: `COLORS.error` (#ba1a1a)
